From 1bb65da600c9fed99c2419f24178e6de79f3b27d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pm-official-id <pm-official-id@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:22:14 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] OTA live updates from the origin repo
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The updater now watches pm-official-id/lokal-player for skins-channel
releases (mobile-v…-skinsN) instead of upstream. Each release carries
full-metadata.json (flavor, version, versionCode, sha256) and the arm64
APK; the app checks on launch and on connectivity, shows the notes,
downloads through the system downloader, verifies the SHA-256 and the
package identity, and hands the APK to Android's installer.

The manifest gains REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES and the FileProvider the
installer code already expected — upstream shipped neither, so its
install path could not complete. Build code bumped to 1001 so skins4
offers itself to every earlier build.

Verified live on an emulator: the launch check found skins4 unattended,
downloaded it, verified it, and raised the system's 'update Lokal Skins'
prompt. Unit tests cover channel filtering, build comparison, checksum
and origin-URL enforcement.
